#
# Counter-example for math:VariableOccurrenceShape: a math:VariableOccurrence with no
# math:declaredVariable (sh:minCount 1), so it resolves to nothing and is not marked
# free. Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:UnscopedVariableOccurrence).
# Bound by ex:ecVariableUnscoped.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:danglingOccurrence a math:VariableOccurrence ;
    math:occursInScope ex:someScope .

ex:someScope a math:MathematicalExpression .
